# Code review

When the user says `/codereview`, "review this", "check this diff", or "did the agent finish":

1. Read `.cursor/skills/code-review/SKILL.md` and root `AGENTS.md`.
2. Run `git diff` / `git diff --stat` (not the agent summary).
3. If a related file exists under `specs/`, verify each ID against the diff.
4. Report **Ready to commit** or ranked **Blocking issues**.
5. Append new lesson classes to `AGENTS.md` when found.
